    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\n\r\nPrime c.1.2 Acre Building Site\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a prime c.1.2 acre site located in a peaceful countryside setting just off the main Kiltimagh to Swinford Road.\r\n\r\nThe site previously benefited from planning permission and offers an ideal opportunity for those wishing to construct their dream home, subject to obtaining the necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\nThis attractive site enjoys a convenient location close to both Kiltimagh and Swinford while retaining the benefits of rural living.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\n• Prime c.1.2 acre site\r\n• Previous planning history (Ref: P06/7390)\r\n• Ideal opportunity for a one-off family residence\r\n• Excellent road access\r\n• Attractive countryside setting\r\n• Subject to planning permission being obtained\r\n• All local amenities within easy reach\r\n• Strong demand location\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights\r\n\r\n• Just off the Kiltimagh to Swinford Road\r\n• Approx. 5 minutes drive to Kiltimagh\r\n• Approx. 10 minutes drive to Swinford\r\n• Approx. 20 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\r\n• Close to schools, church, shops, restaurants, hotels and sporting facilities\r\n• Convenient to Claremorris, Ballyhaunis and Charlestown\r\n\r\nThis site offers the perfect opportunity for local applicants or those seeking to build a family home in a sought-after rural location.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents.\r\n\r\nMartin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioneers\r\n\r\nMIPAV MMCEPI\r\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\r\n\r\n094 9362216 | 086 2130723\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer\r\n\r\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided."
      },
